  "description": "The user is projected onto the recipient of the threat, as the text explicitly addresses 'you' ('don't ever think you got away...'). The user identifies with the person being warned or threatened, imagining themselves as the target of the speaker's vengeance. This projection is reinforced by the visual of Al Pacino, who is positioned as the authoritative enforcer of the threat.",
